    <string name="about_title">ZViewer · Local comic reader</string>
    <string name="about_description">Version %1$s\n\nSupports ZIP / CBZ, RAR / CBR, 7Z, PDF, image folders, and common video formats. Supports APNG, animated WebP, GIF, AVIF, and common still images.\n\nAll reading data stays on this device. ZViewer only connects to the internet to check for and download updates. It never uploads your reading files. Convert password-protected files, split archives, and DRM-protected files before opening them.\n\nOpen-source components: AndroidX / Compose (Apache 2.0), Media3 (Apache 2.0), APNG4Android (Apache 2.0), libarchive (BSD), and libavif (BSD).\n\nHEIF / HEIC support depends on the device decoder.</string>
